{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","title":"StandardContext","modules":[{"name":"StandardContext"}],"externalID":"StandardContext","roleHeading":"Framework"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stamp every event with the app, device, operating system, locale and network connection it was tracked on."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each standard value has an enricher of its own, and nothing is added to a record until the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"builds its tracker with that enricher. Each one sets a typed ","type":"text"},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" key whose value a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination reads from the record’s context: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/ApplicationKey","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/DeviceKey","type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/OperatingSystemKey","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/LocaleKey","type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/NetworkKey","type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[